      "sourceTextSha256": "49e969551f0d64b591f46d16c1891c676e9cd88ab233bdd409f2e46695956132",
      "text": "After breakfast, discover Sugar Loaf Mountain, rising abruptly from the edge of the bay. A cable car takes you up to Urca Hill, the stop between ground level and the summit, where you can enjoy a cocktail or sample Brazilian specialities.\n\nFrom the top of Sugar Loaf, Copacabana Beach stretches away to your left, with the outlines of the Two Brothers and Gávea mountains on the horizon; below lies the small Red Beach, and to your right Guanabara Bay, Niterói, Botafogo and the centre, beneath the silhouette of Christ the Redeemer. An essential visit to understand the beauty of Rio.",
